WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:04,220
This contract alone is worth a cute ghost hotel

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,940
Who are you?

3
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:10,090
So, you agreed

4
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:12,660
As long as you can capture that piece of land

5
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:16,180
Help me restore the strength of the Ghost King and keep the memory of my husband

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,180
I promise

7
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:35,268
Then it's settled

8
00:00:35,268 --> 00:00:43,960
Better spend money
